# Intake and catalog

- Catalog **templates** are libraries. Assignment is Intake Analyst `catalog_hint` + policy, never `resolve_catalog_template` / `intent_patterns` / `process_type_hint` as a hard route.
- When intake did not run or is degraded, user DMs stay `GenericTaskWorkflow`. Do not regex-assign a catalog.
- `soft_catalog_candidates` may appear in the intake prompt as dismissible evidence only.
- Canary/heartbeat/system are not user work: never `wait_active` / `attach_active` onto them. Low confidence → clarify (or wait on one **user** active), not silent `create_fresh`.
- Plugin stop/cancel/abort/halt only when the **whole message** is that command. Incidental “stop” still goes through `POST /tasks`.
- Mirror plugin edits in both `/root/.openclaw/rmp/plugins/rmp_adapter/index.js` and `/root/.openclaw/plugins/rmp_adapter/index.js`.
